      "id": "sol.amc-8-1985-p8.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Substituting \\(a = -2\\) gives the values \\(-3a = 6,\\) \\(4a = -8,\\) \\(\\dfrac{24}{a} = -12,\\) \\(a^2 = 4,\\) and \\(1.\\)\n\nThe largest of these is \\(6,\\) which is \\(-3a.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is A .",
